	(text "Slice_BUCK switch stage: SPICE test bench (hardware/sim/check.py).\nRefs and values mirror hardware/buck_conv.kicad_sch. Bench-only parts:\nV1 12 V bus (ideal), V2 + R201 the Nano D9 pin (0/5 V, ~25 ohm),\nR101 L2 winding resistance, R100 load (altered per case),\nV3 + R107/R108/C108: copies of R7/R8/C8 on an ideal 12 V for the A0 scale.\nGrounds: GND here is both GND and GNDPWR of the board.\nModels: models/generic.lib (generic, not vendor; see that file)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
